[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3591858332","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113335#issuecomment-3591858332","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113335","id":3591858332,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7WF2ic","user":{"login":"SleepyMode","id":28950192,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4OTUwMTky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28950192?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SleepyMode","html_url":"https://github.com/SleepyMode","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SleepyMode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SleepyMode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SleepyMode/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SleepyMode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SleepyMode/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SleepyMode/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SleepyMode/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SleepyMode/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SleepyMode/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-29T18:36:43Z","updated_at":"2025-11-29T18:36:43Z","body":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/editor/version_control/editor_vcs_interface.cpp#L364\nThe files are opened with `FileAccess.WRITE` and thus are truncated.\n\nPretty easy to fix but we might want to consider how we want to do this:\n- Do we want to check if the file already exists, and if it does, just append to it?\n- If the file already exists, do we just not touch it?\n- If the file already exists, do we warn the user and truncate anyway?\n\nAll of them are pretty straightforward to do (except maybe the third as this originates externally from the dialog itself but still not a big deal).\nI honestly think just appending is probably fine.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3591858332/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3600964351","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113335#issuecomment-3600964351","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113335","id":3600964351,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Wolr_","user":{"login":"ChristosMaragkos","id":180113798,"node_id":"U_kgDOCrxRhg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180113798?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChristosMaragkos","html_url":"https://github.com/ChristosMaragkos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChristosMaragkos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChristosMaragkos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChristosMaragkos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChristosMaragkos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChristosMaragkos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChristosMaragkos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChristosMaragkos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChristosMaragkos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChristosMaragkos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-02T09:05:26Z","updated_at":"2025-12-02T09:05:26Z","body":"Working on a fix for this. IMO, truncating the file and overriding it should not be done in order to preserve the existing `.gitignore` configuration.\nThe most sensible way to handle it is probably to append to the existing file silently to align the current process with the desired outcome (the user not losing their `.gitignore` file).","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3600964351/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]